      },
      "Spawned": [
        "Powderline, Field lead, reporting from the cut stone pits and freight lifts."
      ],
      "WakeUp": [
        "Eyes up. Red Quarry Combine still has work to finish."
      ],
      "Attacking": [
        "Powderline taking the field lead lane. no one works a blast alone."
      ],
      "Chasing": [
        "Keep my signal. I'm pushing them toward the the cut stone pits and freight lifts."
